Files: src/3rdparty/QHotkey/*
Copyright: 2016 Felix Barz
License: BSD-3-clause
Comment: The release tarball ships no licence file for QHotkey. The text
 was retrieved from the upstream project
 (https://github.com/qr243vbi/QHotkey) and the vendored qhotkey.h is
 byte-identical to that project's QHotkey/qhotkey.h; the hash is recorded
 in /usr/share/doc/nekobox/third-party/upstream/PROVENANCE.txt, and the
 licence text is in upstream/QHotkey/LICENSE.

Files: src/3rdparty/ini/*
Copyright: the iniqt.hpp authors; the shipped header contains no copyright notice
License: GPL-3
Comment: Vendored from https://github.com/qr243vbi/iniqt.hpp, which declares
 GPL-3.0; the vendored ini.h is byte-identical to upstream main/iniqt.hpp
 (hash in upstream/PROVENANCE.txt). The header itself has no licence
 statement, so the repository declaration plus the file match are the
 evidence. GPL-3 text: /usr/share/common-licenses/GPL-3.

Files: src/3rdparty/URLParser/*
Copyright: 2017 DONGBUM, KIM
License: MIT
Comment: The release tarball ships no licence file. Both vendored headers
 are byte-identical to the upstream project's files; the MIT text is in
 upstream/URLParser/LICENSE and the hashes are in upstream/PROVENANCE.txt.

Files: src/3rdparty/LRUCache/*
Copyright: 2012-22 Saurav Mohapatra <mohaps@gmail.com>
License: ISC
Comment: The release tarball ships no separate licence file. The notice in
 LRUCache11.hpp is copied to
 /usr/share/doc/nekobox/third-party/generated/inline/LRUCache/.

Files: src/3rdparty/qv2ray/*
Copyright: Qv2ray contributors; individual notices where present
License: GPL-3
Comment: Files copied from Qv2ray (https://github.com/Qv2ray/Qv2ray), whose
 repository declares GPL-3.0. The copied files without their own header are
 covered by that project licence; they were not audited file by file and
 the exact upstream revision is not recorded. QvProxyConfigurator.cpp is not
 compiled: USE_CPP_PROXY_CONFIGURATOR is undefined, so its body is empty.

