Files: src/gharqad/sys/AutoRun.cpp
Copyright: NekoBox contributors
License: GPL-3
Comment: The file contains an attributed snippet headed "launchatlogin.cpp
 / ShadowClash / Copyright (c) 2019 Coel Wu" and a comment referring to
 nextcloud/desktop utility_unix.cpp. The notice is preserved verbatim in
 generated/inline/nekobox/. The licence of those portions is not stated in
 the file; it is recorded as unresolved in upstream/PROVENANCE.txt and is
 not asserted here. The rest of the file follows the package licence.

Files: res/qss/AMOLED.qss
Copyright: Jaime A. Quiroga P. (GTRONICK)
License: MIT
Comment: The shipped file keeps the GTRONICK header but its body was
 rewritten by NekoBox and differs from the current GTRONICK file. The
 GTRONICK/QSS project declares MIT; text in upstream/GTRONICK-QSS/LICENSE.
 The exact upstream revision is not recorded.

Files: res/qss/MaterialDark.qss
Copyright: 2016 Marcus Ottosson
License: MIT
Comment: The file begins with "/* Avalon stylesheet */". Its content matches
 getavalon/core avalon/style/style.qss (branch master) except for 21 diff
 lines at retrieval. MIT text in upstream/Avalon/LICENSE. The exact upstream
 revision is not recorded.

Files: res/qss/Aqua.qss
Copyright: Ktiseos-Nyx/qss_themes contributors (no copyright notice shipped)
License: unresolved
Comment: Byte-identical to
 themes/AESTHETICS_INSPIRED/Metro_Ocean.qss from
 https://github.com/Ktiseos-Nyx/qss_themes at retrieval (sha256 in
 upstream/PROVENANCE.txt). That repository declared no licence at
 retrieval. No licence is asserted here.

Files: res/qss/Kawaii.qss
Copyright: Ktiseos-Nyx/qss_themes contributors (no copyright notice shipped)
License: unresolved
Comment: A modified copy of themes/FOOD_INSPIRED/sweet_treats_kawaii.qss
 from https://github.com/Ktiseos-Nyx/qss_themes (70 diff lines at
 retrieval; hash in upstream/PROVENANCE.txt). That repository declared no
 licence at retrieval. No licence is asserted here.

Files: res/qss/feiyangqingyun/*
Copyright: unknown; no copyright notice is shipped
License: unresolved
Comment: One icon, qss/blacksoft/arrow_bottom.png, is byte-identical to
 ui/core_qss/qss/blacksoft/arrow_bottom.png in
 https://github.com/feiyangqingyun/QWidgetDemo, which declares the Mulan
 PSL v1 (text in upstream/QWidgetDemo/LICENSE). The three .qss files are
 "Breeze Light - QSS approximation" rewrites that do not match QWidgetDemo,
 and the other checked icons did not match. The provenance of the remaining
 files is not established; no licence is asserted for them.

Files: res/rc/*
Copyright: unknown; no attribution is shipped
License: unresolved
Comment: These Qt stylesheet example images (stylesheet-vline.png,
 branch_closed.png, checkbox_checked.png, ...) are embedded through
 res/darkstyle.qrc. No source, revision or licence text is shipped with
 them. The Qt example code copied elsewhere in this tree is BSD-3-clause,
 but that is not treated as evidence for the images. No licence is asserted.

Files: res/icon/*.png
Copyright: unknown; no attribution is shipped
License: unresolved
Comment: These button icons have no source, revision or licence metadata in
 the tarball. Some names (internet-web-browser, preferences, system-run)
 are common desktop-theme names and the material/ subset uses Material
 Design icon names, but that is not evidence of the exact origin. No licence
 is asserted for them.

Files: res/icon/material/*
Copyright: unknown; no attribution is shipped
License: unresolved
Comment: The file names are Material Design icon names, but no source,
 revision or licence statement is shipped with these PNGs. The origin is not
 established; no licence is asserted here.

