License: per-module
 The files under debian/third-party/ (generated/go/, generated/cpp/,
 generated/inline/ and upstream/) are verbatim copies of third-party
 licence and notice material. This packaging does not relicense them.
 Each component's own terms apply; they differ per component (MIT,
 BSD-2-clause, BSD-3-clause, ISC, Apache-2.0, MPL-2.0, GPL-3 and others).
 The copied file is authoritative and this stanza deliberately does not
 summarise or replace it.

License: unresolved
 No licence text is available in the upstream release or at the project the
 file appears to come from. This is recorded as an open question; no licence
 is asserted.
